1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,122
Don't make these five mistakes in Japan.

2
00:00:02,572 --> 00:00:06,720
Don't tip. Tipping is not part of the
culture, and it can confuse the staff.

3
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:09,176
Don't take phone calls on the train.

4
00:00:09,196 --> 00:00:13,022
Riders are asked to put phones on silent
and keep calls for outside.

5
00:00:13,472 --> 00:00:16,028
Don't stick chopsticks upright in your
rice.

6
00:00:16,048 --> 00:00:17,922
That is linked to funeral rites.

7
00:00:18,372 --> 00:00:22,067
Don't walk into an onsen with a visible
tattoo without asking.

8
00:00:22,087 --> 00:00:25,742
Tattoos are tied to the yakuza, so most
hot springs ban them.

9
00:00:26,192 --> 00:00:29,073
Don't pack cold medicine with
pseudoephedrine, or Adderall.

10
00:00:29,093 --> 00:00:32,978
These stimulants are banned, even with a
prescription, and you can be detained.

